# Project 2 local artefacts.
#
# The root .gitignore already covers node_modules/, dist/, .env and *.sqlite.
# What it does not cover is SQLite's WAL sidecar files, which exist only while
# the database is open — long enough for a `git add -A` during a running server
# to sweep a binary journal into a commit. Kept here rather than in the root
# .gitignore because spec §25 reserves root changes for M8.

*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-journal

# Generated evaluation output (the dataset itself stays committed). Nothing
# writes here until the eval harness lands in M6; the rule exists first so the
# first run cannot accidentally commit its results.
server/eval-results/
